---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';

const lang = 'en' as const;
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | LiveElectric"
  description="LiveElectric privacy policy for personal data processing on the live-line operations management platform."
  lang={lang}
>
  <Navbar lang={lang} />

  <main id="main-content" class="py-16 md:py-20">
    <section class="container-shell">
      <article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 shadow-card md:p-10">
        <p class="eyebrow">Legal document</p>
        <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-5xl leading-[0.92] text-dark md:text-6xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: February 5, 2026.</p>

        <div class="policy-content mt-8 space-y-6">
          <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
          <p>LiveElectric (hereinafter "LiveElectric") is responsible for processing personal data collected through its website and live-line operations management platform.</p>
          <h2>2. Data we collect</h2>
          <p>We may collect the following categories of data:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Identification and contact data (name, email, phone, role, company).</li>
            <li>Platform usage data (users, activity logs, timestamps, and executed actions).</li>
            <li>Operational evidence uploaded by users (photos, documents, and records linked to checklists).</li>
            <li>Technical data (IP address, device, browser, sessions, technical cookies).</li>
          </ul>
          <h2>3. Processing purposes</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Provide the contracted service and maintain platform operational continuity.</li>
            <li>Manage user accounts, authentication, security, and traceability.</li>
            <li>Respond to commercial inquiries, demo requests, and technical support.</li>
            <li>Improve features, usability, performance, and service security.</li>
            <li>Comply with applicable legal, regulatory, or contractual obligations.</li>
          </ul>
          <h2>4. Legal basis</h2>
          <p>We process personal data based on: (a) contract performance, (b) compliance with legal obligations, (c) legitimate interest in security and service improvement, and (d) consent where applicable.</p>
          <h2>5. Data retention</h2>
          <p>We retain data for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes described, legal obligations, and applicable audit periods. When no longer needed, data is securely deleted or anonymized.</p>
          <h2>6. Sharing and transfers</h2>
          <p>We may share data with technology providers that deliver services for LiveElectric (hosting, infrastructure, monitoring, support), under confidentiality and security agreements. We do not sell personal data.</p>
          <h2>7. Information security</h2>
          <p>We apply reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect data against unauthorized access, loss, alteration, or destruction, including access controls, audit logs, and infrastructure safeguards.</p>
          <h2>8. Data subject rights</h2>
          <p>Data subjects may request access, rectification, updating, objection, or deletion of their personal data, in accordance with applicable regulations, by writing to the contact email listed in this policy.</p>
          <h2>9. Cookies</h2>
          <p>We use technical and performance cookies necessary to operate the site and improve its functionality. If we incorporate non-essential cookies, we will request consent where applicable.</p>
          <h2>10. Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p>We may update this policy to reflect service improvements or regulatory changes. The current version will be published at this same URL with its update date.</p>
          <h2>11. Contact</h2>
          <p>For privacy inquiries or to exercise your rights, write to: <a href="mailto:contacto@liveelectric.app">contacto@liveelectric.app</a></p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer lang={lang} />
</Layout>
